					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Per <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName>, compatrem nostrum, mones, domine et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>compater in Christo charissime, ut Locos meos, posteaquam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tandem absoluti sunt, praelo committam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hanc ad<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>monitionem praevenit typographus, qui eos ante <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>septimanas aliquot misso huc sororio suo prope <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>adhuc calidos abs me accepit et praelo subiiciendas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>abstulit, quod sic fieri potest, ut ad futuras <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>vernas Francovadienses nundinas in lucem prodeant, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nisi censores <placeName ref="l28">Basileenses</placeName> moras nectant et impediant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Dominus, in cuius manu sunt omnia, bene vertat <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>hanc aeditionem et in utilitatem ecclesiarum dirigat!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Quod nuncupationem illius attinet, opus habeo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>consilio tuo.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Impedit contentia sacramentaria, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ne cuilibet dedicandum sit hoc opus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8101">Lelius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>noster urget iam secundo, ut nuncupem illud <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>serenissimo <placeName ref="l2449">Boemiae</placeName> regi <persName ref="p8282">Maximiliano</persName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Credo <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quidem vera esse, quae de illo praedicat; verum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sunt, quae pudorem meum, ne id facile faciam, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>remorantur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8399">Guilelmus</persName>, <placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergensis</placeName> diaconus, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>cum hic esset, obtestabatur me, ut dedicem <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName ref="p2411">elctori Palatino</persName>; sunt, qui <placeName ref="l830">Anglicanis</placeName> ecclesiis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>profuturum sperant, si <persName ref="p18465">reginae Elizabethae</persName> dedicem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Sic haereo dubius, quo inclinem, quare te oro, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ut communices mihi tuum consilium, deinde mittas <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ad me titulos, quibus eiusmodi magnatibus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>scribi solet; sum enim illorum ignarus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Caeterum per gratiam domini cum meis satis <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>adhuc commode vivo, nisi quod senectus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>subinde velut <placeName ref="l2549">Aphrica</placeName> novi aliquid ex im<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>proviso apportet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Annum elapso autumno 63. <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ingressus sum, quem climatericum vocant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Forsan opus hoc Locorum communium ultimus est <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>senectus meae partus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quod bonum est in <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>oculis domini fiat.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Versor iam in ex<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>plicanda epistola ad Galatas.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ora, quaeso, dominum, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ut per spiritum su m veram apostoli sententiam <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>intelligere largiatur.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Optime vale, charissime <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>compater, et ignosce, quod tam raras a me literas <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>accipis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Per d. <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName>, quod hic desyderari potest, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>abunde sarcitur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te tuosque mei omnes, praesertim <lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName ref="p2207">Ioannes Heinricus</persName>, filius tuus in Christo.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta symmystas <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>tuos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 1559. 21. novembris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8417">Wolfg[angus<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>] <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>M<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>u<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>sc<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>[<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>ul<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>us]</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>t<lb xml:id="p2z30"/>uus<lb xml:id="p2z42"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
